# Org configuration, embedded in compass at build time (plan decision 7).
#
# OKF_ORG is the GitHub account or organisation that owns the okf fork and
# every repo listed in a hub's repos.txt. `compass hub assemble` accepts only
# https://github.com/$OKF_ORG/ URLs.
# An OKF_ORG environment variable overrides this value; the hub actions set it
# to the hub repo's owner, so CI follows the hub when it moves.
OKF_ORG=tuan-nng
